{"slug": "volume7/106", "title": "Form No. 12", "volume": "volume7", "sourceUrl": "https://budget.up.nic.in/Fin_H_Book/volume7/106.html", "html": "<font size=\"4\">\n<p align=\"CENTER\"><font color=\"#0000A0\">F. A. R. FORM No. 12</font></p>\n<p align=\"CENTER\"><font color=\"#0000A0\">(See para. 108)</font></p>\n<p align=\"CENTER\"><font color=\"#0000A0\">FOREST\nDEPARTMENT———————————</font></p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><font color=\"#0000A0\">Salary Bill of Non-Gazetted Officers (Subordinate\nForest Service, Office and other establishments)</font></p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><font color=\"#0000A0\">Salary List of Permanent Establishment of\nthe———————————Division\nfor———————19 .</font></p>\n</font>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"1\" width=\"639\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"37%\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><font color=\"#0000A0\" size=\"4\">Head\n    of Service</font></p></td>\n<td colspan=\"11\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"63%\"><font size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><font color=\"#0000A0\">Voucher\n    no.——————of————————19\n    .</font></p></font></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"11%\"><font size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><font color=\"#0000A0\">1</font></p></font></td>\n<td valign=\"TOP\" width=\"11%\"><font size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><font color=\"#0000A0\">2</font></p></font></td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"12%\"><font size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><font color=\"#0000A0\">3</font></p></font></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"7%\"><font size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><font color=\"#0000A0\">4</font></p></font></td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"11%\"><font size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><font color=\"#0000A0\">5</font></p></font></td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"12%\"><font size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><font color=\"#0000A0\">6</font></p></font></td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"12%\"><font size=\"4\"><p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><font color=\"#0000A